---
// Counseling, "What is counseling?" (2026-11-18, replaces the photo carousel). The 1-in-5 figure, the session rhythm,
// and what happens in talk therapy, all from the section copy.
import Icon from "../../Icon.astro";
---
<figure class="gx on-dark" aria-label="One in five adults lives with a mental health condition. Counseling sessions run about 60 minutes, once or twice a week. You and a licensed clinician talk it through, work through difficult situations and conditions like depression and anxiety, and build coping strategies that stick.">
  <div class="gx-two">
    <div class="gx-box gx-stat">
      <p class="gx-people" aria-hidden="true">{[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map((k) => <span class:list={[k === 2 && "on"]}><Icon name="users" class="h-6 w-6" /></span>)}</p>
      <p><strong>1 in 5</strong><span>adults lives with a mental health condition</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="gx-box gx-stat">
      <p class="gx-dial" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="clock" class="h-7 w-7" /></p>
      <p><strong>~60 min</strong><span>a session, once or twice a week</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="gx-t">How talk therapy helps</p>
  <ol class="gx-flow">
    <li><span class="gx-i i-b"><Icon name="chat" class="h-5 w-5" /></span><span>Talk with a licensed clinician</span></li>
    <li><span class="gx-i i-s"><Icon name="brain" class="h-5 w-5" /></span><span>Work through hard situations, <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/depression/">depression</a> or <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/anxiety/">anxiety</a></span></li>
    <li><span class="gx-i i-g"><Icon name="shield" class="h-5 w-5" /></span><span>Build coping strategies that stick</span></li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption class="gx-foot"><Icon name="check" class="h-4 w-4" />Feel better and function better, at your own pace</figcaption>
</figure>
